Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?SDRAM:=20=E7=AE=80=E5=8C=96=20DPI-C=20=E8=AF=BB?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=86=99=E6=8E=A5=E5=8F=A3=EF=BC=8C=E5=8E=BB=E6=8E=89=E7=89=87?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=80=89=E5=8F=82=E6=95=B0?=
